---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: legionOperator calls publishTgeDetails(askToken, totalSupply, allocatedTokens)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_validate: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: askToken == address(0) or totalSupply == 0
    q_validate --> q_set_tge: askToken valid and totalSupply > 0
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidTgeDetails
    q_set_tge --> q_set_supply: askToken = askToken
    q_set_supply --> q_emit: totalTokenSupply = totalSupply, allocatedTokenAmount = allocatedTokens
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TgeDetailsPublished(askToken, totalSupply, allocatedTokens)

    note right of q_set_tge
        INV-001: askToken must be a valid non-zero ERC20 address
        INV-002: TGE details can only be published after sale conclusion
        INV-003: allocatedTokenAmount determines total tokens available for distribution
    end note
